<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Email Verification</title>

```
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f7f7f7;
    color: #333333;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 30px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: #222222;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }

  .otp {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background-color: #f0f4ff;
    color: #007bff;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  .warning {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #666666;
  }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 30px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #888888;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
```

  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Email Verification</h2>

```
  <p>
    Hello <%= name %>,
  </p>

  <p>
    We received a request to verify your email address
    <strong><%= email %></strong>
    for your Justice Desk account.
  </p>

  <p>
    Please use the OTP below to verify your email address:
  </p>

  <div class="otp">
    <%= otp %>
  </div>

  <p>
    This OTP will expire in
    <strong><%= expirationMinutes %> minutes</strong>.
  </p>

  <p class="warning">
    If you did not request this email verification, please ignore this
    email. Do not share this OTP with anyone.
  </p>

  <div class="footer">
    &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Justice Desk.
    All rights reserved.
  </div>
</div>
```

  </body>
</html>
